[
  {
    "RowOffset": 459234,
    "RowId": 25941,
    "Text": "It's about to get turbulent in here! Take care you don't get sucked in!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459318,
    "RowId": 25942,
    "Text": "She's hidden herself! Find her quickly, or you'll be in for a world of pain!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459406,
    "RowId": 25943,
    "Text": "All right, let's see how well you handle the big girl."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459474,
    "RowId": 25944,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459486,
    "RowId": 25945,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459498,
    "RowId": 26000,
    "Text": "I'm the only one fit to protect her..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459550,
    "RowId": 26001,
    "Text": "The Light will cleanse your sins!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459594,
    "RowId": 26002,
    "Text": "Come! Show me your strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459634,
    "RowId": 26003,
    "Text": "Let's try something else."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459670,
    "RowId": 26004,
    "Text": "It's time we settled this."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459710,
    "RowId": 26005,
    "Text": "Only I can protect her!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459746,
    "RowId": 26006,
    "Text": "To think that this could be born from my memories..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459810,
    "RowId": 26007,
    "Text": "That creature is passing on its aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459862,
    "RowId": 26008,
    "Text": "The Light's so strong, I can't sense anything else..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459926,
    "RowId": 26009,
    "Text": "I sense a surge in aether..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 459966,
    "RowId": 26010,
    "Text": "The blade is imbued with Light!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460010,
    "RowId": 26011,
    "Text": "Wait... Didn't Gaia do something like this?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460066,
    "RowId": 26012,
    "Text": "We can't fail here! We can't!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460106,
    "RowId": 26013,
    "Text": "Defeat the Fatebreaker"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460142,
    "RowId": 26014,
    "Text": "I've toyed with you long enough."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460186,
    "RowId": 26015,
    "Text": "No... She still needs me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460226,
    "RowId": 26016,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460238,
    "RowId": 26017,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460250,
    "RowId": 26018,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460262,
    "RowId": 26019,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460274,
    "RowId": 26020,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460286,
    "RowId": 26100,
    "Text": "Defeat the Cloud of Darkness"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460326,
    "RowId": 26101,
    "Text": "No light could ever reach us..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460370,
    "RowId": 26102,
    "Text": "We shall engulf everything in our shadow..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460426,
    "RowId": 26103,
    "Text": "By the power of Darkness, we call forth life, boundless and irrepressible."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460514,
    "RowId": 26104,
    "Text": "The Darkness swallows all, even the ground beneath your feet."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460586,
    "RowId": 26105,
    "Text": "Clinging to one another will only hasten your descent..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460654,
    "RowId": 26106,
    "Text": "With balance comes life, insatiable and all-consuming."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460722,
    "RowId": 26107,
    "Text": "We shall return all to nothingness."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460770,
    "RowId": 26108,
    "Text": "Hope, despair...they are what feeds us..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460822,
    "RowId": 26109,
    "Text": "Unleash the shadows!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460854,
    "RowId": 26200,
    "Text": "I will imitate your every move. When you attack, I attack. When you cast a spell, I'll cast a spell."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460966,
    "RowId": 26201,
    "Text": "...So you seek to do perfectly nothing, perfectly? A clever tactic, but I have the entire Masked Carnivale to mimic. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461094,
    "RowId": 26202,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461106,
    "RowId": 26203,
    "Text": "What's taking so long!? Drop the performance art and go for the throat, just like you've seen me doing business!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461230,
    "RowId": 26204,
    "Text": "Very well. I shall emulate your way of “doing business.”"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461302,
    "RowId": 26205,
    "Text": "Behold the essence of mimicry...\nI answer your arcane assault in kind!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461386,
    "RowId": 26206,
    "Text": "Anything you can do, I can do better...\nA strike for a strike!"
  },
  {
