    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462578,
    "RowId": 26300,
    "Text": "Protect Alisaie!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462606,
    "RowId": 26301,
    "Text": "Channel aether to Alisaie!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462646,
    "RowId": 26302,
    "Text": "Defeat the 2nd Order rocksplitter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462694,
    "RowId": 26303,
    "Text": "Channel more aether to Alisaie!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462738,
    "RowId": 26304,
    "Text": "The girl seeks to harm the patriarch with vile magicks! Kill her! Slaughter, slay, kill!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462838,
    "RowId": 26305,
    "Text": "Not if we have anything to say about it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462890,
    "RowId": 26306,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>─draw the golems to me! I'll deal with them all at once!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 462978,
    "RowId": 26307,
    "Text": "...Yes, it's ready! Go, Angelo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463022,
    "RowId": 26308,
    "Text": "Ugh, his tempering is too severe... \\\\<huff> I can't finish the job..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463102,
    "RowId": 26309,
    "Text": "So one person's aether alone is not enough..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463158,
    "RowId": 26310,
    "Text": "They're targeting Alisaie! Everyone, gather close!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463222,
    "RowId": 26311,
    "Text": "Alphinaud! Let us lend Alisaie our aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463278,
    "RowId": 26312,
    "Text": "Thanks, you two... I'll give it another try!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463334,
    "RowId": 26313,
    "Text": "Ungh... I am nearing my limit..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463378,
    "RowId": 26314,
    "Text": "Seven hells, there's too many..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463422,
    "RowId": 26315,
    "Text": "Leave this to me! Stand clear, all of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463478,
    "RowId": 26316,
    "Text": "Of all the reckless things... Alisaie─now's your chance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463550,
    "RowId": 26317,
    "Text": "All right! Please... Please let this work!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463606,
    "RowId": 26318,
    "Text": "\\\\<huff> Almost there... \\\\<puff> <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, please lend me your aether too!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463698,
    "RowId": 26319,
    "Text": "Hehehe, you're dead now, girl! Finished, done for, dead!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463766,
    "RowId": 26320,
    "Text": "No, Admiral! It's too dangerous!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463810,
    "RowId": 26321,
    "Text": "I made my decision before I came here. No matter what it costs me, Limsa will have peace."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463910,
    "RowId": 26322,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463922,
    "RowId": 26323,
    "Text": "Slay the last one! Exterminate, destroy, slay!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 463982,
    "RowId": 26324,
    "Text": "Thank you! It will work this time, I promise!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 464038,
    "RowId": 26325,
    "Text": "Ugh, just what we need..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 464074,
    "RowId": 26326,
    "Text": "Bombs! We can't let them get near Alisaie!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 464130,
    "RowId": 26327,
    "Text": "Curses, more of them... Spread out and hold them off!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 464194,
    "RowId": 26328,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, a little more aether! Just a little more, and I can finish this!"
  },
