    "RowId": 26499,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 466870,
    "RowId": 26500,
    "Text": "Defeat Misija and her imperial troops!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 466922,
    "RowId": 26501,
    "Text": "Defeat Delta Gabriel!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 466954,
    "RowId": 26502,
    "Text": "Take no prisoners. I want them all dead!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467006,
    "RowId": 26503,
    "Text": "あの金色の機体は、私が引き付けましょう！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467078,
    "RowId": 26504,
    "Text": "解放者殿は、ミーシィヤと、\nその他の魔導兵器を頼みます……！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467182,
    "RowId": 26505,
    "Text": "Admirable... But futile nonetheless. Ready the delta armor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467254,
    "RowId": 26506,
    "Text": "皆さん、私のところへ集まってください！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467322,
    "RowId": 26507,
    "Text": "くっ……皆さん、ご無事ですか……！？"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467390,
    "RowId": 26508,
    "Text": "あの攻撃を耐え抜いただと……！？\nだが、これで終いと思うなよ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467498,
    "RowId": 26509,
    "Text": "New magitek armor!? When did they find the time to─\nNo matter. We've come too far to retreat now."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467614,
    "RowId": 26510,
    "Text": "We must divide and conquer, Blade <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,2)>. I will draw this one's attention!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467710,
    "RowId": 26511,
    "Text": "I will see to Misija. The remaining magitek armor is yours."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467782,
    "RowId": 26512,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467794,
    "RowId": 26513,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467806,
    "RowId": 26600,
    "Text": "Round"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467822,
    "RowId": 26700,
    "Text": "Clear staging node A"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467854,
    "RowId": 26701,
    "Text": "Clear staging node B"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467886,
    "RowId": 26702,
    "Text": "Clear staging node C"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467918,
    "RowId": 26703,
    "Text": "Clear staging node D"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467950,
    "RowId": 26704,
    "Text": "Clear the ascension platform"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 467990,
    "RowId": 26705,
    "Text": "Clear Beyond"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468014,
    "RowId": 26706,
    "Text": "This is the tower's network. Its digital consciousnesses are here."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468094,
    "RowId": 26707,
    "Text": "Don't waste time trying to understand. We're here to kill the enemy. That's all."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468186,
    "RowId": 26708,
    "Text": "What, aren't you enjoying yourselves?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468234,
    "RowId": 26709,
    "Text": "You know what will happen to the sphere's creations when it's destroyed."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468318,
    "RowId": 26710,
    "Text": "Don't worry about it. There's no actual meaning behind anything machines do."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468406,
    "RowId": 26711,
    "Text": "It's locked."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468430,
    "RowId": 26712,
    "Text": "Right─I'll hack the door, you infiltrate the network and take down any guards."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468522,
    "RowId": 26713,
    "Text": "We're in! Let's go."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468554,
    "RowId": 26714,
    "Text": "Here we go again.\nHacking in three...two...!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468614,
    "RowId": 26715,
    "Text": "Whatever they're planning, we need to stop them before it's too late!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468694,
    "RowId": 26716,
    "Text": "To live...is to know loneliness...\nTo live...is to know love..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468774,
    "RowId": 26717,
    "Text": "I'll live as many times as it takes...\nI'll die as many times as it takes...\nTo know... To know... To know..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468902,
    "RowId": 26718,
    "Text": "They're all─\n<i>No</i>!\nI don't want to be alone..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 468978,
    "RowId": 26719,
    "Text": "Let your voices...be heard..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469018,
    "RowId": 26720,
    "Text": "Sing with me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469046,
    "RowId": 26721,
    "Text": "Such...delights... Did you...have fun?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469098,
    "RowId": 26722,
    "Text": "You will be among the first to see the new world..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469162,
    "RowId": 26723,
    "Text": "Destroy the target."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469194,
    "RowId": 26724,
    "Text": "...But we still have some time. Why not enjoy it?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469254,
    "RowId": 26725,
    "Text": "Multiple heat signatures coming from around the target.\nBe ready!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469334,
    "RowId": 26726,
    "Text": "Can you hear it? The final song..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469382,
    "RowId": 26727,
    "Text": "We've waited so long to throw these gates wide..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469442,
    "RowId": 26728,
    "Text": "Let the light in!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469470,
    "RowId": 26729,
    "Text": "Where...?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469490,
    "RowId": 26730,
    "Text": "All memory lives within me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469530,
    "RowId": 26731,
    "Text": "It's manipulating the space around us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469582,
    "RowId": 26732,
    "Text": "So many dreams slumber here..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469626,
    "RowId": 26733,
    "Text": "Right below us!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469654,
    "RowId": 26734,
    "Text": "Each memory's form is unique."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469694,
    "RowId": 26735,
    "Text": "Watch the periphery!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469726,
    "RowId": 26736,
    "Text": "We will sooなく...danger...the traんろ.\nTo ensure your safety...pleassssさイ..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469826,
    "RowId": 26737,
    "Text": "Again!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469846,
    "RowId": 26738,
    "Text": "The final song...just for you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469890,
    "RowId": 26739,
    "Text": "You'll need to match wavelengths to create interference."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 469958,
    "RowId": 26740,
    "Text": "You would render all this meaningless?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470010,
    "RowId": 26741,
    "Text": "You will soon find out how lowly you are."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470062,
    "RowId": 26742,
    "Text": "They're going to fall. Move!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470102,
    "RowId": 26743,
    "Text": "                    AH♪\n               ah♪\nah♪ ah♪"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470178,
    "RowId": 26744,
    "Text": "Even if you defeat us... Do you really think you'll win?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470246,
    "RowId": 26745,
    "Text": "We're prepared to fight until the end. Yours, or ours."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470314,
    "RowId": 26746,
    "Text": "You fight and fight and fight...\nYou're made that way, after all."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470394,
    "RowId": 26747,
    "Text": "You have so little control over your nature..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470454,
    "RowId": 26748,
    "Text": "All you can do is watch as the world falls to ruin."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470518,
    "RowId": 26749,
    "Text": "A logic virus! It's interfering with my hacking!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470578,
    "RowId": 26750,
    "Text": "Destroy its core!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470606,
    "RowId": 26751,
    "Text": "We made it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470630,
    "RowId": 26752,
    "Text": "Not half bad."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470654,
    "RowId": 26753,
    "Text": "Your little alliance is pointless."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470702,
    "RowId": 26754,
    "Text": "You'll never compare to us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470742,
    "RowId": 26755,
    "Text": "Ahahaha! You probably think you're clever.\nBut we've had just about enough..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470834,
    "RowId": 26756,
    "Text": "Massive energy readings! Don't take your eyes off it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470898,
    "RowId": 26757,
    "Text": "Self-replication! There's another on the side!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470958,
    "RowId": 26758,
    "Text": "Get as far away as you can!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 470998,
    "RowId": 26759,
    "Text": "It'll knock us off if we're not careful."
  },
  {
