  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472030,
    "RowId": 26800,
    "Text": "Defeat the Telophoroi troops"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472070,
    "RowId": 26801,
    "Text": "Locate the lunar primal"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472106,
    "RowId": 26802,
    "Text": "Defeat the enemy forces"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472142,
    "RowId": 26803,
    "Text": "Defeat Lunar Odin and defend the aetherial confluence"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472206,
    "RowId": 26804,
    "Text": "Defeat Lunar Ravana and defend the aetherial confluence"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472274,
    "RowId": 26805,
    "Text": "Defeat Lunar Ifrit and defend the aetherial confluence"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472342,
    "RowId": 26806,
    "Text": "Listen well, friends.\nThe Telophoroi are sweeping across Carteneau."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472426,
    "RowId": 26807,
    "Text": "As for the Ascian, he was briefly sighted above the battlefield, but has since vanished.\nHe likely intends to watch events unfold from afar."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472582,
    "RowId": 26808,
    "Text": "Thus far, the movements of the lunar primals have proven difficult to predict.\nEven when poised to ambush our troops, they instead withdraw for some unknown reason..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472762,
    "RowId": 26809,
    "Text": "Whatever the Telophoroi's plan may be, the primals are our primary targets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472850,
    "RowId": 26810,
    "Text": "Understood! They will not elude the Scions for long!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 472914,
    "RowId": 26811,
    "Text": "Let us divide our forces that we may locate the primals more swiftly. Thancred, Y'shtola, and I shall head east..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473042,
    "RowId": 26812,
    "Text": "Then I'll go west. <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, Alphinaud─ Come with me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473118,
    "RowId": 26813,
    "Text": "I'll concentrate my efforts on the tempered. With luck, I should have the chance to cure some of them."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473234,
    "RowId": 26814,
    "Text": "I will keep them occupied! The rest of you, seek out the primals!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473310,
    "RowId": 26815,
    "Text": "Th-There are so many of them..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473354,
    "RowId": 26816,
    "Text": "I won't be curing anyone at this rate... We'll have to incapacitate them first!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473446,
    "RowId": 26817,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473458,
    "RowId": 26818,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473470,
    "RowId": 26819,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473482,
    "RowId": 26820,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473494,
    "RowId": 26821,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473506,
    "RowId": 26822,
    "Text": "Their tempering has gone too far to treat them here on the battlefield..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473590,
    "RowId": 26823,
    "Text": "With this degree of physical alteration, I fear they are beyond help. Imperials or no, I hate to see them in such pain..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473722,
    "RowId": 26824,
    "Text": "We must see that their suffering is not prolonged!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473786,
    "RowId": 26825,
    "Text": "No more reinforcements, at least for the time being... Is everyone all right?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473874,
    "RowId": 26826,
    "Text": "Is that...Odin? So the time has come to pit my blade against his. Follow my lead!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 473966,
    "RowId": 26827,
    "Text": "Leave the chains to me! Urianger, it's your turn to act as shield!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474046,
    "RowId": 26828,
    "Text": "This does not bode well... We'd best brace ourselves!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474110,
    "RowId": 26829,
    "Text": "Ugh... Such strength! It will take all three of us to protect the confluence!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474198,
    "RowId": 26830,
    "Text": "But first, Thancred doth require our aid!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474250,
    "RowId": 26831,
    "Text": "Odin is preparing to strike again! Stay out of his reach, but guarding the confluence must come first!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474366,
    "RowId": 26832,
    "Text": "He yet stands... A glutton for punishment, it would seem."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474434,
    "RowId": 26833,
    "Text": "In which case, I'd be glad to oblige him!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474486,
    "RowId": 26834,
    "Text": "So it falls to us to protect the confluence from this fiend..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474562,
    "RowId": 26835,
    "Text": "That must be Ravana! A formidable opponent, by all accounts, but so are we!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474650,
    "RowId": 26836,
    "Text": "Like moths to the flame... We have to keep them from the confluence, but there are so many!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474754,
    "RowId": 26837,
    "Text": "Then allow me! A quick casting of Break should buy us time!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474826,
    "RowId": 26838,
    "Text": "That was a little close for comfort...\nBut now's our chance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474902,
    "RowId": 26839,
    "Text": "He's gathering aether... G'raha, try stopping him with Break!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 474974,
    "RowId": 26840,
    "Text": "I have a way of breaking his defenses, but I'll need time. Keep him occupied!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475062,
    "RowId": 26841,
    "Text": "Understood! Let us hope that Break works as intended..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475130,
    "RowId": 26842,
    "Text": "All right, I'm ready... It's now or never!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475186,
    "RowId": 26843,
    "Text": "Lunar Ifrit... The one Arenvald and Fordola encountered!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475254,
    "RowId": 26844,
    "Text": "This one is not to be taken lightly. Be on your guard."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475322,
    "RowId": 26845,
    "Text": "Whatever those are, they bode ill for us. Smash them to pieces, before it's too late!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475418,
    "RowId": 26846,
    "Text": "More of them!? Our foe seeks to destroy the confluence, and us along with it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475506,
    "RowId": 26847,
    "Text": "So, it's come to this..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 475542,
    "RowId": 26848,
    "Text": ""
  }
